Test setup:
uv venv --python 3.14 .venv
call .venv\Scripts\activate.bat

Install the built wheel:
uv pip install .\dist\oead-*.whl

Install pytest:
uv pip install pytest


Run the functional tests:
python -m pytest -q test\aamp\test_aamp_empty_strings.py test\aamp\test_aamp_roundtrip.py test\byml\test_byml_roundtrip.py test\gsheet\test_gsheet_roundtrip.py test\sarc\test_sarc_get_file.py test\sarc\test_sarc_roundtrip.py test\yaz0\test_yaz0.py

Run all tests, including benchmarks:
python -m pytest -q test
